# Canvas drawing

## Annotation model

- Prefer an **immutable** list (or equivalent) of annotation shapes so undo/redo is a history of snapshots or inverse commands
- Mutations create new state; do not mutate shape objects in place during tool handlers

## Draw loop

- Keep the render/draw path allocation-light (avoid creating paths/objects every frame when reuse is easy)
- Separate **model** (shapes + selection) from **view** (canvas/DOM rendering)
- Selection chrome is blue; draw stroke/fill for shapes is red — see [PRODUCT.md](../../PRODUCT.md)
